      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Day 19 Solution: Version Control & Backing Up\n\nDay 19 is about export/import and backup scripting outside n8n, not a new build. This file is a small self-documenting workflow recording the naming convention and folder structure, plus an HTTP call standing in for a scheduled backup export. Credentials needed: None needed to test the logic in n8n; filesystem/SSH access is needed for the real backup script (outside n8n).\n\nSee DAILY_TASKS/DAY_19_Version_Control_Backing_Up.md.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 500
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "trigger1",
      "name": "Manual Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.manualTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        80,
        140
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    },
    {
      "id": "set1",
      "name": "Define Backup Convention",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        320,
        140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "name": "naming_convention",
              "value": "[category]-[function]-v1-[date].json"
            },
            {
              "name": "folder_structure",
              "value": "n8n-backups/YYYYMMDD/"
            },
            {
              "name": "example_filename",
              "value": "={{ 'week3-triggers-v1-' + $now.format('yyyyMMdd') + '.json' }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "code1",
      "name": "Simulate Backup Script Run",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        560,
        140
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "const now = new Date();\nconst folder = 'n8n-backups/' + now.toISOString().slice(0,10).replace(/-/g, '');\nreturn [{ json: { backup_folder: folder, files_backed_up: 2, ran_at: now.toISOString() } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "set2",
      "name": "Document Backup Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        800,
        140
      ],
